[[Stone Armor]] is a neutral [[Armor]] normally obtained by combining a [[Leather Armor]] with a [[Stone Skin Potion]]. It gives a very large amount of {{icon/block}} on battle start, and slowly depletes the opponent's {{icon/spikes}} and {{icon/empower}}, which can be very useful against such builds. It also gains a large chunk of block proportional to the player's health when they drop below 50% for the first time in the fight. These are some significant advantages, but they come along with the significant disadvantage of +20% stamina consumption. Of course, this drawback can be offset by not relying too heavily on high stamina-demand weapons.

Because of the high start of battle {{icon/block}}, [[Stone Armor]] is one of the best targets for [[Echoing Battlecry]].

